  "contentHtml": "<div class=\"se-viewer se-theme-default\" lang=\"ko-KR\">\n    <!-- SE_DOC_HEADER_START -->\n    <!--@CONTENTS_HEADER-->\n    <!-- SE_DOC_HEADER_END -->\n    <div class=\"se-main-container\">\n                <div class=\"se-component se-text se-l-default\" id=\"SE-551e1075-1dcc-4fff-a2ca-45dc2180713c\">\n                    <div class=\"se-component-content\">\n                        <div class=\"se-section se-section-text se-l-default\">\n                            <div class=\"se-module se-module-text\">\n                                    <!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-ed6fc5c5-9c77-45be-b31f-99dd39668759\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-38de35ea-e07b-11ee-a4e3-53f9a0b09f5a\">블로그를 너무 잘하고 싶다는 말이다. </span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-05da108d-386a-47cf-a238-08b193c1b694\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-38de35eb-e07b-11ee-a4e3-1931e5ce35ed\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-863604ac-7b8f-4dca-9707-0ce8e8f7d162\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-38de35ec-e07b-11ee-a4e3-77edd2fb0182\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-a130a6af-858f-49ea-aae2-da39f3adb7fc\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-38de35ed-e07b-11ee-a4e3-616b48418752\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-7128596f-b637-449d-b560-459b2f96e7a7\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-38de5cfe-e07b-11ee-a4e3-f3ccf64dcd73\">누군가가 보기 싫어졌는건</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-75e03719-1230-4f0b-afb1-4246f88db3e8\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-38de5cff-e07b-11ee-a4e3-87e51bc3df52\">사실 그사람한테 너무 인정받고 싶다는 말이다. </span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-59120e06-d8df-4445-9fd0-caffc2724160\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-38de5d00-e07b-11ee-a4e3-993e459eeb67\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-3a24aa43-e079-11ee-aa6a-bb1e16bf9407\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-38de5d01-e07b-11ee-a4e3-bd1686088068\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-3a24aa46-e079-11ee-aa6a-dd0ec1010968\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-38de5d02-e07b-11ee-a4e3-9ddd4df13697\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-3a24aa49-e079-11ee-aa6a-bb76555bf5cf\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-38de5d03-e07b-11ee-a4e3-07b78f1c3cdb\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-3a24aa4b-e079-11ee-aa6a-e9b2d0187102\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-38de5d04-e07b-11ee-a4e3-bb92ffc6bb9f\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-0f19f67f-d403-4133-886c-b435364f4afc\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-38de5d05-e07b-11ee-a4e3-59813b971721\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-fdb342fc-ad5f-467a-9519-a182790c4f05\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-38de5d06-e07b-11ee-a4e3-e9aa8cf3231b\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-b56eef24-b3c3-44ec-9fd8-1def02781db7\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-38de5d07-e07b-11ee-a4e3-3b2a13cc82e0\">최근에 내 유튜브를 보지 않았다. 어느 시점부터인가 영상에서 보이는 내 모습이 싫었다. 내가 아는 나는 저런 사람이 아닌데, 다른 사람 같았다. 그래서 옛 영상을 많이 지웠고 그나마 봐줄만한 영상만 남겼다. </span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-3a24aa4e-e079-11ee-aa6a-8f4e4ee2c179\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-38de5d08-e07b-11ee-a4e3-d3f43cf9ccc7\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-de60d4d9-8570-46ea-a335-ad736fb88735\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-38de5d09-e07b-11ee-a4e3-dd1fde914aa3\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-709df856-06d7-4043-95ce-059e8896bc08\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-38de5d0a-e07b-11ee-a4e3-91900ed2eb7d\">유튜브에서의 내 모습이 싫다는건 유튜브를 찍는데 스트레스를 받는다는 말이다. </span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-3a24aa51-e079-11ee-aa6a-edae8d471b16\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-38de5d0b-e07b-11ee-a4e3-ddd9a192bd01\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-3a24aa53-e079-11ee-aa6a-6d3187944d1a\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-38de5d0c-e07b-11ee-a4e3-85df57e825c1\">더 잘하고 싶다는 뜻이다. </span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-3a24aa56-e079-11ee-aa6a-25dc1cd2f432\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-38de5d0d-e07b-11ee-a4e3-71ddd4e73c6b\">더 잘 할 수 있다는 말이다. </span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-3a24aa58-e079-11ee-aa6a-d171cad6e8cc\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-38de5d0e-e07b-11ee-a4e3-834cf0e4360f\">근데 그게 잘 안된다는 말이다. </span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-9065f712-e079-11ee-aa6a-c739126781ba\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-38de5d0f-e07b-11ee-a4e3-39d474fd122e\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-9065f715-e079-11ee-aa6a-570b87cac414\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-38de5d10-e07b-11ee-a4e3-2bf6d544ae09\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-9065f718-e079-11ee-aa6a-bb90235c83dc\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-38de5d11-e07b-11ee-a4e3-a768551b8479\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-9065f71b-e079-11ee-aa6a-319fb68214a5\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-38de5d12-e07b-11ee-a4e3-3b00a852d1d8\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-9065f71e-e079-11ee-aa6a-9b0b9cc09e33\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-38de5d13-e07b-11ee-a4e3-2fb80d67776b\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-c7d190fa-635f-403f-852e-614934a50332\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-38de5d14-e07b-11ee-a4e3-b7c7333a00f2\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-9065f721-e079-11ee-aa6a-9170a2d85b0b\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-38de5d15-e07b-11ee-a4e3-1d930005d256\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-9065f723-e079-11ee-aa6a-6952389b8041\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-38de5d16-e07b-11ee-a4e3-73d0994d2c01\">살다보면 잘하고 싶은게 생긴다. </span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-9065f726-e079-11ee-aa6a-b370fb1782e3\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-38de5d17-e07b-11ee-a4e3-e75bd21f82fb\">잘하고 싶은 사람이 생긴다. </span><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-38de5d18-e07b-11ee-a4e3-a184fa521731\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-7242d16b-e079-11ee-aa6a-73018c01150d\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-38de5d19-e07b-11ee-a4e3-3bc87350e7bf\">그래서 </span><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-38de5d1a-e07b-11ee-a4e3-5fdf9b9beb69\">잘하고 싶을수록 스트레스를 받는다. </span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-38de35e7-e07b-11ee-a4e3-cb87519ab511\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-38de5d1b-e07b-11ee-a4e3-a9582972ce0c\">분명</span><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-38de5d1c-e07b-11ee-a4e3-2fe7ccc5ec39\"> </span><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-38de5d1d-e07b-11ee-a4e3-89b3f7f924f0\">잘하고 싶을수록 더 못하게된다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-7242d16f-e079-11ee-aa6a-53dd417bc04e\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-38de5d1e-e07b-11ee-a4e3-a1063d15f5d7\">아니...</span><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-38de5d1f-e07b-11ee-a4e3-058cabf1e11a\">더 못한 것만 같다. </span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-7242d173-e079-11ee-aa6a-d9e687c96c48\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-38de5d20-e07b-11ee-a4e3-ed8ffe68488b\">그게 참 아쉬울때가 많다.</span><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-38de5d21-e07b-11ee-a4e3-21f5d540c21d\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-d2a9ad38-fc02-41e9-813b-4b9efe264d28\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-38de5d22-e07b-11ee-a4e3-b1194e966bc1\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-da2ba02e-7fe3-4fee-a20e-901b861ceb6d\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-38de5d23-e07b-11ee-a4e3-2182447af9b3\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-2a493bed-aac1-4d74-bfdc-0c65ed914eb9\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-38de5d24-e07b-11ee-a4e3-a7bb278e8df5\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-3a24aa5b-e079-11ee-aa6a-7d55529de2c7\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-38de5d25-e07b-11ee-a4e3-cb6426c10cd0\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-3a24aa5d-e079-11ee-aa6a-212e2a8427b5\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-38de5d26-e07b-11ee-a4e3-438e3479f31b\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-3a24aa60-e079-11ee-aa6a-9b9d81ac33f9\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-38de5d27-e07b-11ee-a4e3-73d7b2c64ef7\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-1caa26d7-6318-4842-b4ef-c47e67eaa3fd\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-38de5d28-e07b-11ee-a4e3-db25b13b4fd3\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-3564edf8-aaa3-426d-8a14-b4fcc223a021\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-38de5d29-e07b-11ee-a4e3-53740b9e4677\">지하철에서 이어폰을 끼면 지하철 소리때문에 음악이 안 들릴때가 있다. 반면 분명 지하철에서는 안들렸는데 그 음량으로 도서관에서 들으면 민폐가 될때도 있다. 상황에 따라 음량조절이 필요하다. 음량을 조절하려면 소리를 올려도 보고 내려도 봐야한다. </span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT -->\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>                <div class=\"se-component se-image se-l-default\" id=\"SE-0cc72966-c3dc-419a-8ae4-9994456cb249\">\n                    <div class=\"se-component-content se-component-content-normal\">\n                        <div class=\"se-section se-section-image se-l-default se-section-align-\" style=\"max-width:340px;\">\n                                <div class=\"se-module se-module-image\" style=\"\">\n                                    <a href=\"#\" class=\"se-module-image-link __se_image_link __se_link\" style=\"\" onclick=\"return false;\" data-linktype=\"img\" data-linkdata='{\"id\" : \"SE-0cc72966-c3dc-419a-8ae4-9994456cb249\", \"src\" : \"https://search.pstatic.net/common/?src=http%3A%2F%2Fblogfiles.naver.net%2FMjAyMDA5MTdfODgg%2FMDAxNjAwMzQyODEzMTA4.QsNOVX2zlIEHmTxgBneMaM44HIOPYGnK_h4sg5xT9ykg.9ZufYzFBZEa9qCe6Ssfaqe0fWD4wMT-5vDQR2PKn8TQg.JPEG.toto7340%2FIMG_7227E3417CD2-1.jpeg&type=ofullfill340_600_png\", \"originalWidth\" : \"340\", \"originalHeight\" : \"600\", \"linkUse\" : \"false\", \"link\" : \"\"}'>\n                                        <img src=\"https://search.pstatic.net/common/?src=http%3A%2F%2Fblogfiles.naver.net%2FMjAyMDA5MTdfODgg%2FMDAxNjAwMzQyODEzMTA4.QsNOVX2zlIEHmTxgBneMaM44HIOPYGnK_h4sg5xT9ykg.9ZufYzFBZEa9qCe6Ssfaqe0fWD4wMT-5vDQR2PKn8TQg.JPEG.toto7340%2FIMG_7227E3417CD2-1.jpeg&type=ofullfill340_600_png\" alt=\"\" class=\"se-image-resource\" />\n                                    </a>\n                                </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"se-component se-text se-l-default\" id=\"SE-04511796-4e11-4120-ba70-e6fd4824e742\">\n                    <div class=\"se-component-content\">\n                        <div class=\"se-section se-section-text se-l-default\">\n                            <div class=\"se-module se-module-text\">\n                                    <!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-4e0cecd1-0a52-47a1-b1fe-fb045f5d5602\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-38de843a-e07b-11ee-a4e3-61ba77ee03b2\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-3a24aa62-e079-11ee-aa6a-7f7dda0a3c6c\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-38de843b-e07b-11ee-a4e3-4b5b9fe00381\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-3a24aa64-e079-11ee-aa6a-e123e1f91f3d\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-38de843c-e07b-11ee-a4e3-97873c265963\">가끔 속마음과 행동이 반대일 때가 있다. 분명 유튜브를 잘하고 싶은데 유튜브를 안하게 된다거나, 블로그를 잘하고 싶지만 쓰기 싫어진다거나, 누군가가 보고 싶은데 먼저 연락하기 싫다거나 할 때 말이다. </span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-3a24aa66-e079-11ee-aa6a-ff60531e3d78\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-38de843d-e07b-11ee-a4e3-277167cfa419\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-3a24aa68-e079-11ee-aa6a-c78a3271a703\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-38de843e-e07b-11ee-a4e3-b348da08dde4\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-3a24aa6a-e079-11ee-aa6a-5706b06043a5\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-38de843f-e07b-11ee-a4e3-dba28d89a2e9\">조절되는 중이다. 조금만 기다리면 